Z||000000||My7Fieros||09-06-2000||10:51 PM||||Yup! Heres the deal. This was last year a few days before Christmas. I was at home when my g/f called me and said that Britney Spears and Justin Timberlake (from N'Sync) were at the restaurant where she works. I knew this to be true because several people have told me that theyve been in there before. Justin Timberlake is from here (Memphis) and still lives here when hes not out doing "his thing" or whatever. Well, at that time rumours were going around that the two were dating.<BR>So anyway naturally I fly up there and sure enough, there they were. It was Justin and his parents and Britney. So I go to the table and stand there for what seemed to be forever looking like a dumbass Im sure when Justin looks up at me and says "hey how ya doing?" and sticks out his hand and we shake hands...the guys was super nice, really down to earth. Well we talk for a minute and finally I tell him that I want their autographs. Im not a real big fan of either of them, but some of their stuff is ok.<BR>Anyway she looks up at me and just stares for a minute. Im thinking, "what the hell is she thinking right now?"...well, I finally (after wiping the drool off my chin....MEE OWW!!) give her a piece of paper and a pen and she signs "love Britney"...(um, yes I do!    <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"> )..then she says "do me a favor and dont tell anyone that Im here"...<BR>uh..ok....sure I said.<BR>Well I go to the bar and get a beer and hang out for a while. Well, when I go to leave, Im outside unlocking my car door. I look up and there they are getting into Justin's Porsche Boxter right next to me! Justing says, "Man thats a cool car, take it easy dude!" Well then Britney says "What is it?"...<BR>I wasnt sure how to take it because she always seems to have this blank look on her face, so I said "Its a Fiero".  "Oh ok" she says..<BR>Hmmmmmm, well needless to say I was pretty happy from meeting them. Funny thing is, that next day a friend of mine on the Sheriffs Dept told me he pulled them over on Woodstock Cuba Rd. in north Memphis for speeding! <BR>He didnt write them though.........    <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/wink.gif"><P>[This message has been edited by My7Fieros (edited 09-06-2000).]<p>[This message has been edited by My7Fieros (edited 09-06-2000).]||||reg||4
